# AGENTS.md

# Ulo — House of Stories — Mobile Engineering Instructions

This document defines the architecture, technology choices, coding standards, product rules, UI rules, and development constraints for the **Ulo — House of Stories** mobile application.

AI coding agents MUST read and follow this document before making changes to the project. Designs live in **Google Stitch** — never invent UI.

---

# 0. Stitch — Source of Truth for UI

All mobile UI is designed in Google Stitch. The frontend agent must implement Stitch exports verbatim, not generic Tailwind UIs.

- Project: `projects/14264674603951156260` — `Ulo — House of Stories — Mobile App` — https://stitch.google.com/projects/14264674603951156260
- Design System: `assets/10531941693422165094` — `Ulo — Black Heritage` — `theme.bodyFont=INTER headlineFont=INTER colorMode=DARK roundness=ROUND_TWELVE customColor=#000000 colorVariant=NEUTRAL`
- Every new screen MUST select this Design System when generating.
- Device: `MOBILE` `390×852` portrait only (screenshots export `780×1768` etc). **All Stitch prompts MUST start with `MOBILE NATIVE APP 390×852 portrait, pure black #000000`** — never generate Desktop/web.
- Tokens (mobile = black, not web green):
  ```
  background #000000
  surface #0A0A0A / #111111 / #1A1A1A / #222222
  card #0A0A0A border 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08) radius 16/32
  text cream #F2EDE0 primary
  text muted #A8A8A8 / #8A8A8A secondary
  accent gold #C9993A (CTA / active / ring / spinner)
  gold-10% rgba(201,153,58,0.10) banners
  ```
- Fonts: Stitch uses `INTER` (mobile). Web uses Poppins/Lora — do not mix. Mobile typography: Poppins mapping → Inter Semibold for headlines, Inter Regular for body.
- Stitch HTML: `projects/.../files/<htmlId>` is React Native blueprint. Convert `className` Tailwind → `NativeWind className` on `View/Text/Pressable`. Keep `bg-[#000000]`, `rounded-[32px]`, `border-white/5` exactly.

If Stitch is throttling (`MCP error -32001`): paste manual `MOBILE NATIVE` prompts from git / task, do **not** invent new colors.

---

# 1. Project Overview

Ulo — House of Stories is a family legacy vault: **Every story has a home. Bring every story home.** (Ulo = house in Igbo).

Users create **Rooms** for life moments. The app connects authenticated members and their extended family/guests:

- Onboarding (4 slides, MOBILE NATIVE black)
- Auth (Login / Sign Up)
- Member Dashboard — house stats, rooms, recent stories, events
- Room Detail — hero, tributes, candles, story feed, contribute gate
- Open a New Room — occasion picker sheet (7 occasions)
- Wedding Funnel — `/weddings/create` style wizard (mobile native)
- Pricing — 5 regions single-card, savings = 12×monthly − yearly
- Checkout — payment verification polling (`/checkout/{payment}`) `pending → successful/failed`
- Guest Share Room — public `/share/rooms/{slug}` 2-col story grid, gold Share pill, contribution gate
- Search — pill input, filter chips, room rows 56px thumb
- Notifications — list, mark-read
- Analytics — DashboardService stats, storage, activity
- Video Reels — vertical TikTok-style viewer 9:16 snap (immersive, muted scrim bottom)
- Family House Access — token entry `POST /house/access` crypto token
- Client Dashboard — `/client/dashboard` for paid consumers
- Settings & House — members list, house avatar, logout, account

Priorities: simplicity, readability, accessibility, reliability, security, clear payment amount before confirm, minimal auth friction, **pure black premium heritage — NOT generic AI SaaS**.

---

# 2. Product Model

3 surfaces share one Laravel backend:

```
House Owner / Member  →  Web Dashboard (Inertia)  ─┐
                                                    ├─→ Laravel Backend (v13, PHP 8.5) → PostgreSQL + Stripe/Paystack/PayPal + Storage
Authenticated Member →  Mobile App (Expo)         ─┘
Guest (no login)     →  Public share /house/access, /share/rooms/{slug}
```

```
Laravel Backend (Sanctum + Fortify)
        |
        +----------→ config/pricing.php (single currency per region)
        +----------→ app/Services/RoomService.php (domain rule: room_type → tier)
        +----------→ app/Services/DashboardService.php::getDashboardData()
        +----------→ routes/web.php (web) + routes/api.php (mobile)
```

Mobile must never call Stripe/Paystack/PayPal directly. Mobile only:
`POST /api/rooms`, `GET /api/rooms`, `POST /api/checkout/initialize`, `GET /api/checkout/{payment}/status` (poll 3s), `GET /api/share/rooms/{slug}`, `POST /api/house/access`.

---

# 3. Technology Stack — MUST MATCH WEB’s Tailwind System

## Mobile
- React Native + Expo SDK 57 + Expo Router
- TypeScript **strict** (`any` forbidden, use `unknown`)
- **NativeWind** — this **is** TailwindCSS v4 for React Native. Same tokens as web (`tailwindcss: v4`). Do not introduce another styling framework. Use `className="flex-1 bg-[#000000] px-5"` not inline style objects.
- Tailwind config shares tokens with web: `background #000000`, `surface #0A0A0A`, `gold #C9993A`, `cream #F2EDE0`. Centralize in `src/constants/theme.ts` / `tailwind.config.js`.
- TanStack Query for ALL server state (queries/mutations/infinite)
- Zustand only when client global state genuinely required
- React Hook Form + Zod
- Expo SecureStore (auth tokens ONLY)
- Expo Linking (deep links) + Expo Notifications (push later)
- lucide-react-native (ALL icons) + react-native-reanimated + gesture-handler only when needed

Do not add native UI frameworks (UI Kitten, NativeBase, etc.).

